OL,3,GNEWSAMorrisons could be built at
OL,4,Ashopping centre site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a Morrisons supermarket
OL,7,Fat an aging shopping centre site in
OL,8,FEast Sussex will go before councillors
OL,9,Ffor approval next week.
OL,11,FA revamped proposal to redevelop the
OL,12,FMeridian Centre site in Peacehaven has
OL,13,Fbeen submitted to Lewes District
OL,14,FCouncil, and will be debated by the
OL,15,Fauthority's planning committee next
OL,16,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
