OL,3,GNEWSAMorrisons could be built at
OL,4,Ashopping centre site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service, the new proposal
OL,8,Fmakes some changes to previous plans
OL,9,Fwhich had been approved in 2023,
OL,10,Fincluding a smaller supermarket
OL,11,Fbuilding.
OL,13,FThe construction of a new library
OL,14,Fbuilding no longer features in the
OL,15,Fproposal, while planned renovations to
OL,16,Fthe Community House centre will be
OL,17,Fsmaller in scale.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
